-- versioned chain of steps used in a workflow as one step, and `automation_version`, its versions.
-- They follow skills exactly: shared (tenant_id null, seen only in operator sessions, as templates
-- are, ARCHITECTURE §4) or written for one client; versions immutable except `status`. New tables
